    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d393-a11">

                <pb facs="0457" n="407" xml:id="pg407"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure A in No.
                    275.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Castello to Mr.
                            Maguire.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Maritime Custom-House,
                    Tampico</hi></placeName>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Agreeably to your verbal request bearing on the memorandum you handed me touching
                    information you sought regarding the light-house and tonnage dues imposed on
                    Mexican and foreign vessels in their movements at this port, I beg to hand you a
                    statement explanatory of the different methods pursued, as set forth in your
                    memorandum.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José F. Castello.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Tampico</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1894-04-09">April 9, 1894</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
